WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
Good morning, John.

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:02.500
This video contains a lot of flashy lights,

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.220
and the theme song from the show 'Friends'.

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.800
Consider yourself warned!

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.200
Okay, we've never done this,

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.800
so if we suck,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
we've still got the footage.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.520
[crowd cheering]

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.300
One, two, one two three go!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:24.500
So no one told you life was gonna be this way,

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.660
your job's a joke, you're broke,

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.400
your love life's DOA (Dead On Arrival) !

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.800
It's like you're always stuck in second gear,

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:36.700
when it hasn't been your day, your week,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:39.600
your month, or even your year, but

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.100
I'll be there for you

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.100
when the rain starts to pour

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.200
I'll be there for you

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.200
like I've been there before

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.100
I'll be there for you

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.600
cause you're there for me too!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.700
Andrew Huang is consistently one of my favourite YouTubers,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.000
he's also in my band,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.100
Hank Green and the Perfect Strangers,

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.600
and he roped me into this project

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.300
to cover the theme song from 'Friends' in nine different genres.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.600
So if you didn't enjoy mine,

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.300
there's probably one that you will like.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.380
Thank you to Andrew for arranging this,

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:13.300
and doing all the production.

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.700
Thanks to SIim's in San Francisco, where we filmed this,

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.880
and to the Perfect Strangers for performing it with me,

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.220
and thanks to Wheezy Waiter, and all of the people in the crowd,

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.240
who sent me footage for filming this video.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.560
John, you will see me on Friday,

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.580
when we will be resuming our regularly scheduled programming.

